# Reproduction: DeprecationWarning from 'pipx install clang-format==23.1.3' on the ubuntu-24.04 runner (Test cpp run 37528763604, format job).
# Runner image ubuntu24/20260927.320 ships Python 3.12.3 and Pipx 1.16.7 (Ubuntu2404-Readme.md lines 28, 40).
# pipx 1.16.7 runs metadata['Requires-Python']; clang-format 23.1.3 declares no Requires-Python, so importlib.metadata warns.
# pipx 1.17.11 uses metadata.get('Requires-Python') and prints no warning (already fixed upstream).

$ docker run --rm python:3.12.3-slim sh -c "pip install pipx==1.16.7; pipx install --verbose clang-format==23.1.3"
